<view class="page login"><view class="eyebrow">HUAMAO · 花猫</view><block wx:if="{{step === 'login'}}"><view class="login-flower">❀</view><view class="title">把花和它，<view>一起放在心上。</view></view><view class="muted">登录花猫，建立属于你的植物与养宠记录。</view><view class="card body">一个微信身份，对应一个花猫账号。<view>首次登录会自动注册，无需设置密码。</view><view>头像、昵称由你填写，手机号可稍后授权绑定。</view></view><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="notice">本地体验模式：尚未接入微信账号服务。下面只会创建本机体验账号，不会获取微信身份或手机号。</view><view class="consent" bindtap="toggle"><text>{{consent ? '☑' : '☐'}} 我已阅读并同意 </text><text class="link" catchtap="terms">账号与隐私说明</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="login" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{local ? '创建 / 登录本机体验账号' : '微信登录 / 注册'}}</button></block><block wx:else><view class="onboarding-step">最后一步 · 认识一下你</view><view class="title">你和谁，<view>一起迎接花开？</view></view><view class="muted">选择养宠身份，领取你的专属称号。</view><view class="onboarding-options"><button wx:for="{{identities}}" wx:key="value" class="onboarding-option {{identityType === item.value ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="chooseIdentity" disabled="{{busy}}"><image class="onboarding-face" src="/assets/identities/{{item.value}}.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="onboarding-copy"><view class="onboarding-name">{{item.title}}</view><view class="onboarding-label">{{item.label}}</view></view><text class="onboarding-check">{{identityType === item.value ? '✓' : ''}}</text></button></view><view class="muted onboarding-note">这是你自选的生活身份，之后可在“我的”随时修改。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="finishIdentity" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">选好了，进入花猫 →</button></block><view class="notice" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="footer">花草有名字 · 关爱有依据</view></view>
